# Isolation Levels in Spring Boot

Isolation :
- Suppose multiple transaction running in paralle in multithreaded env
  Now how Transaction A is isolated from Transaction B and what is impact they on each other, how
  seperate Transaction A from Transaction B that is define using isolation level
  (Dirty Reads, non-repeatable reads and pahntom reads can happen)
1) DEFAULT
2) READ_COMMITTED
3) READ_UNCOMMITTED
4) REPEATABLE_READ
